<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Commission Ledger — Searvator CRM</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <%- include('partials/mobile-head') %>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-layout">
    <%- include('partials/sidebar', { user: user, activePage: 'commission' }) %>
    
    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="page-header">
            <div>
                <h1 class="page-title">💰 Commission Ledger</h1>
                <p class="page-subtitle">Lead partners & engineers ka wallet · commission tabhi credit hota hai jab client payment aaye</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Summary stats -->
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div class="stat-card amber">
                <div class="stat-label">🔒 Pending (payment awaited)</div>
                <div class="stat-value" style="color: var(--warning);"><%= formatINR(totals.totalPending) %></div>
                <div class="stat-meta">Locked till client pays</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card blue">
                <div class="stat-label">🔓 Earned (ready to pay)</div>
                <div class="stat-value" style="color: #2563eb;"><%= formatINR(totals.totalEarned) %></div>
                <div class="stat-meta">Payment received, payout due</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card green">
                <div class="stat-label">✅ Paid Out</div>
                <div class="stat-value" style="color: var(--success);"><%= formatINR(totals.totalPaid) %></div>
                <div class="stat-meta">Already disbursed</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #6366f1;">
                <div class="stat-label">👥 People</div>
                <div class="stat-value" style="color: #4338ca;"><%= totals.people %></div>
                <div class="stat-meta">Total commission: <%= formatINR(totals.totalCommission) %></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <% if (ledger.length === 0) { %>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-body" style="text-align: center; padding: 50px; color: var(--text-3);">
                    <div style="font-size: 40px;">💰</div>
                    <div style="font-weight: 700; margin-top: 10px;">No commissions yet</div>
                    <p style="font-size: 13px;">Kisi approved quotation ke Job Costing Sheet me Lead Partner ya Engineer set karo, phir yahan wallet dikhega.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        <% } else { %>
            <!-- Per-person wallets -->
            <% ledger.forEach((p, idx) => { %>
                <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
                    <div class="card-header" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="togglePerson(<%= idx %>)">
                        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;">
                            <div style="width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px;">
                                <%= p.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="card-title" style="margin: 0;"><%= p.name %></div>
                                <div class="card-subtitle"><%= p.roles %> · <%= p.orders.length %> orders</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center;">
                            <div style="text-align: right;">
                                <div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-3); text-transform: uppercase;">Balance Owed</div>
                                <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: <%= p.balanceOwed > 0 ? '#2563eb' : '#16a34a' %>;"><%= formatINR(p.balanceOwed) %></div>
                            </div>
                            <span style="color: var(--text-3); font-size: 18px;" id="arrow-<%= idx %>">▼</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Wallet summary bar -->
                    <div class="card-body" style="padding-top: 0;">
                        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 8px;">
                            <div style="background: #fffbeb; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
                                <div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-3);">🔒 Pending</div>
                                <div style="font-weight: 800; color: #d97706;"><%= formatINR(p.pending) %></div>
                            </div>
                            <div style="background: #eff6ff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
                                <div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-3);">🔓 Earned</div>
                                <div style="font-weight: 800; color: #2563eb;"><%= formatINR(p.earned) %></div>
                            </div>
                            <div style="background: #f0fdf4; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
                                <div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-3);">✅ Paid</div>
                                <div style="font-weight: 800; color: #16a34a;"><%= formatINR(p.paid) %></div>
                            </div>
                            <div style="background: #f5f3ff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
                                <div style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-3);">Σ Total</div>
                                <div style="font-weight: 800; color: #6d28d9;"><%= formatINR(p.totalCommission) %></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Order breakdown (collapsible) -->
                    <div id="person-<%= idx %>" style="display: none;">
                        <div class="table-wrap">
                            <table class="data-table">
                                <thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Client</th><th>Role</th><th>Category</th><th>Order Value</th><th>Commission</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <% p.orders.forEach(o => { %>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td class="font-mono font-bold" style="font-size: 11px;">
                                                <a href="/cctv/quotation/<%= o.id %>" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none;"><%= o.num %></a>
                                            </td>
                                            <td style="font-size: 12px;"><%= o.client %></td>
                                            <td><span class="badge <%= o.role === 'Lead' ? 'info' : 'purple' %>" style="font-size: 9px;"><%= o.role %></span></td>
                                            <td style="font-size: 11px;"><%= o.category || '-' %></td>
                                            <td class="font-mono" style="font-size: 12px;"><%= formatINR(o.orderValue) %></td>
                                            <td class="font-mono font-bold" style="color: #6d28d9;"><%= formatINR(o.amount) %></td>
                                            <td>
                                                <% if (o.state === 'Paid') { %>
                                                    <span class="badge success" style="font-size: 9px;">✅ Paid</span>
                                                <% } else if (o.state === 'Earned') { %>
                                                    <span class="badge info" style="font-size: 9px;">🔓 Ready</span>
                                                <% } else { %>
                                                    <span class="badge warning" style="font-size: 9px;">🔒 Pending</span>
                                                <% } %>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    <% }) %>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            <% }) %>
        <% } %>
        
        <!-- Info note -->
        <div class="card" style="background: #f8fafc; margin-top: 8px;">
            <div class="card-body" style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-3);">
                <strong>Kaise kaam karta hai:</strong> Commission har order ke Job Costing Sheet se aata hai. 
                <span style="color: #d97706;">🔒 Pending</span> = client ne full payment nahi kiya (locked). 
                <span style="color: #2563eb;">🔓 Earned</span> = payment aa gaya, ab pay kar sakte ho. 
                <span style="color: #16a34a;">✅ Paid</span> = order ke Manage page pe "Mark Paid Out" kar diya.
                Payout order ke <strong>Job Costing Sheet</strong> se hota hai (wahan "Mark Paid Out" button).
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</div>

<script src="/js/common.js"></script>
<script>
    function togglePerson(idx) {
        const el = document.getElementById('person-' + idx);
        const arrow = document.getElementById('arrow-' + idx);
        if (el.style.display === 'none') {
            el.style.display = 'block';
            arrow.textContent = '▲';
        } else {
            el.style.display = 'none';
            arrow.textContent = '▼';
        }
    }
</script>
</body>
</html>
